<div class="hero"><div class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO MY 3BLD WORKSHOP</div><h1>BLINDFOLDED.<br><span>NOT IN THE DARK.</span></h1><p class="lead">A personal learning hub for 3×3 blindfolded solving. Learn M2 edges, Orozco corners, understand commutators, browse my algorithms and step through moves on a 3D cube.</p><div class="row section"><button class="btn primary" onclick="page('foundations')">Start learning →</button><button class="btn purple" onclick="page('cube')">Open cube lab</button></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="mascot"><svg class="logo-cube" viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="BLD CLUB cube logo"><g fill="#28263e" stroke="#28263e" stroke-width="7" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="100.0,20.0 170.0,60.0 100.0,100.0 30.0,60.0"/><polygon points="30.0,60.0 100.0,100.0 100.0,180.0 30.0,140.0"/><polygon points="100.0,100.0 170.0,60.0 170.0,140.0 100.0,180.0"/></g><polygon points="100.0,23.6 117.0,33.3 100.0,43.1 83.0,33.3" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="76.7,36.9 93.7,46.7 76.7,56.4 59.6,46.7" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="53.3,50.3 70.4,60.0 53.3,69.7 36.3,60.0" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="123.3,36.9 140.4,46.7 123.3,56.4 106.3,46.7" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="100.0,50.3 117.0,60.0 100.0,69.7 83.0,60.0" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="76.7,63.6 93.7,73.3 76.7,83.1 59.6,73.3" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="146.7,50.3 163.7,60.0 146.7,69.7 129.6,60.0" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="123.3,63.6 140.4,73.3 123.3,83.1 106.3,73.3" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="100.0,76.9 117.0,86.7 100.0,96.4 83.0,86.7" fill="#f7f5ed"/><polygon points="33.1,65.4 50.2,75.1 50.2,94.6 33.1,84.9" fill="#54b987"/><polygon points="33.1,92.1 50.2,101.8 50.2,121.3 33.1,111.5" fill="#54b987"/><polygon points="33.1,118.7 50.2,128.5 50.2,147.9 33.1,138.2" fill="#54b987"/><polygon points="56.5,78.7 73.5,88.5 73.5,107.9 56.5,98.2" fill="#54b987"/><polygon points="56.5,105.4 73.5,115.1 73.5,134.6 56.5,124.9" fill="#54b987"/><poly